WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.984
I found the strangest
location on the map!

00:00:03.134 --> 00:00:05.174
Jason... tell me you're
seeing this.

00:00:05.324 --> 00:00:06.716
Seeing what, man?

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:08.694
Something that
shouldn't be there.

00:00:08.844 --> 00:00:13.428
You're telling me we're driving
out here because somebody drew
a flying saucer on a map?

00:00:13.578 --> 00:00:15.018
Not somebody. Cal.

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.024
That's somehow even worse.

00:00:17.174 --> 00:00:23.414
I was scanning Coast Guard traffic.
At 2:13 AM, every channel went dead.

00:00:23.564 --> 00:00:25.580
Maybe they finally got tired
of you listening.

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:29.882
Funny. Because something started
broadcasting on a frequency
that doesn't exist.

00:00:30.032 --> 00:00:31.592
Place looks abandoned.

00:00:31.742 --> 00:00:33.614
Yeah. That's what worries me.

00:00:33.764 --> 00:00:35.372
These tracks are fresh.

00:00:35.522 --> 00:00:37.298
Then somebody's been visiting.

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:39.058
Or somebody never left.

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:41.634
Guys... I just picked up
your location.

00:00:41.784 --> 00:00:43.200
Okay. And?

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:46.374
That's impossible. Your signal
is coming from underground.

00:00:46.524 --> 00:00:48.636
Jason... we're standing outside.

00:00:48.786 --> 00:00:50.178
Tell me that was a plane.

00:00:50.328 --> 00:00:52.272
Planes have engines.

00:00:52.422 --> 00:00:54.582
Guys... get out. Right now.

00:00:54.732 --> 00:00:56.748
Well... that's not creepy at all.

00:00:56.898 --> 00:00:59.610
We came this far. Let's find out
who's hiding.

00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:02.984
That's exactly the kind of sentence
people regret.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:05.240
Someone's watching the whole area.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.392
Not just watching...

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.772
They knew we'd come.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.360
Jason... I'm looking at the same thing
from my end.

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:15.734
That's not a helicopter.

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.276
No. It isn't.

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:22.108
JASON! MOVE!

00:01:22.258 --> 00:01:23.842
I'm trying!

00:01:23.992 --> 00:01:25.912
GET AWAY FROM THE DOOR!

00:01:26.062 --> 00:01:28.774
Jason... how the hell do they
know our names?

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.712
Cal. Tell me you didn't give them
our names.

00:01:31.862 --> 00:01:33.374
Jason... I didn't.

00:01:33.524 --> 00:01:35.708
Lucia... we need to leave.

00:01:35.858 --> 00:01:36.602
Jason...

00:01:36.752 --> 00:01:37.712
What?

00:01:37.862 --> 00:01:38.990
Look behind you.

